["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">追い込む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おいこむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">赶；驱赶；追赶；围捕；逼迫；强迫；使陷入困境；奋力冲刺；竭尽全力；最后冲刺；印刷排版时连排；（棒球）把打者逼至两好球；形成两好球局面</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201221\">とうとう<ruby>土壇場<rp>(</rp><rt>どたんば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>追<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">终于被推到最后的位置。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">追い出す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おいだす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">驱逐；赶出；逐出</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137838\"><ruby>台所<rp>(</rp><rt>だいどころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からその<ruby>猫<rp>(</rp><rt>ねこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>追<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してくれ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把猫从厨房里拿出来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おいて</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">在（某时间或地点）；于；在（某情况、事项等）方面；关于；就；至于；在…方面；由…方面；以…的权限；以…的名义</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202810\">ちょっとの<ruby>時間<rp>(</rp><rt>じかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らないでおいて<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请不要暂时打断电话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">老いる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おいる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">衰老；变老；老化</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226119\">かわいそうな<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にその<ruby>老<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた<ruby>女性<rp>(</rp><rt>じょせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまたもバッグを<ruby>盗<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不幸的是,这位老妇人又偷走了他的行李箱。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">負う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">背负；承载；肩负；承担；担负；负责；负有（义务）；背上（债务、工作等）；受（伤）；蒙受（损失等）；遭受；欠（人情债）；受恩于；感恩于；背靠；背后有…；有…作为后盾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"84286\"><ruby>負<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うた<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えられて<ruby>浅瀬<rp>(</rp><rt>あさせ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>渡<rp>(</rp><rt>わた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">受苦的孩子被教导穿越阿萨德。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">応急</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おうきゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">应急处理；临时措施；暂时解决方案</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217921\">これらの<ruby>建物<rp>(</rp><rt>たてもの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>応急<rp>(</rp><rt>おうきゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>修理<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>必要<rp>(</rp><rt>ひつよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这些建筑需要紧急修复。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">黄金</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おうごん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">金；黄金；金色的；繁荣的；优秀的；卓越的；金钱；现金；大判金币</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184945\"><ruby>絵<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>少女<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>黄金<rp>(</rp><rt>おうごん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではなくて<ruby>花<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のかんむりをかぶっています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">画中的女孩头上戴著的是花冠，不是金皇冠。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/12286670\" title=\"Tatoeba · DaoSeng\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · DaoSeng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">応募</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おうぼ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">应募；报名；参赛；应征</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"84979\"><ruby>夫婦<rp>(</rp><rt>ふうふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でその<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>応募<rp>(</rp><rt>おうぼ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">夫妻可以申请这份工作。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おおい</span><s