rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>肥満<rp>(</rp><rt>ひまん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とはいえないが、<ruby>大柄<rp>(</rp><rt>おおがら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他不是肥胖的,但他是一个伟大的男人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大げさ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おおげさ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">夸大的；过分的；言过其实的；浮夸的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"182133\"><ruby>漁師<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>釣<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げた<ruby>魚<rp>(</rp><rt>さかな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きさをおおげさにいった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">渔民对捕鱼的尺寸表示感激。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大事</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おおごと</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">严重的事情；重大事件；令人严重担忧的事态；危机</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大筋</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おおすじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">大纲；摘要；要点；基本要领</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大空</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おおぞら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">广阔的天空；蓝天；苍穹；穹窿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"155590\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>世<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のどんなことをするよりも<ruby>大空<rp>(</rp><rt>おおぞら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>飛<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>びたい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我想飞到天空,而不是在世界上做任何事情。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大幅</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おおはば</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">大幅度；大规模；剧烈；相当大的；全幅布料（传统和服用约72厘米宽；西式服装用约140厘米宽）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大水</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おおみず</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">洪水；大水</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"180116\"><ruby>橋<rp>(</rp><rt>はし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>大水<rp>(</rp><rt>おおみず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>洗<rp>(</rp><rt>あら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>流<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">桥被大水洗净。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">公</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おおやけ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" l